#### 10. Ignored / Disabled Test — `disabledTest` (line 110)

The test is annotated `@Disabled("flaky, fix later")`. "Fix later" without a tracking issue tends to mean "never."

```java
@Disabled("flaky, fix later")
```

**Fix:** Either fix the flakiness now (the test body looks straightforward) or file a tracked issue and reference it:

```java
@Disabled("Flaky on CI — tracked by JIRA-1234")
```

**Risk if unfixed:** Dead test accumulates; the bug it covers goes undetected.

